{"4276870": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Crow Hunts Worms", "steam_appid": 4276870, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crow Hunts Worms</strong> is an arcade-y action-puzzle game where you analyze, shoot and collapse worms, it may look simple at first but as you progress you will meet different and stronger enemies with environmental obstacles to play around</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLAPSE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/f667c7701292b13527f788e703cdfde6.poster.avif?t=1788253852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/f667c7701292b13527f788e703cdfde6.webm?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/f667c7701292b13527f788e703cdfde6.mp4?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-ups<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/b2230a1d7cd211da79c7cd94998d9878.poster.avif?t=1788253852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/b2230a1d7cd211da79c7cd94998d9878.webm?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/b2230a1d7cd211da79c7cd94998d9878.mp4?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose temporary Power-ups during each level to define your build. Strengthen your weapon, alter its firing behavior, and discover combinations that can transform a difficult infestation into a spectacular chain reaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILL TREE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/71931cf86088ad24fb2037fa7bc94f50.poster.avif?t=1788253852\" width=754 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/71931cf86088ad24fb2037fa7bc94f50.webm?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/71931cf86088ad24fb2037fa7bc94f50.mp4?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between levels, invest your earnings into permanent weapon upgrades. Specialize the Pistol for precise single-target damage or rapid automatic fire, unlock the Shotgun for multi-target pressure, and equip different reload patterns that change how colors are arranged inside your magazine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission introduces a new path and a different tactical problem. Face fast swarms, durable formations, shielded segments, synchronized chains, and carefully authored color arrangements while preventing the worms from reaching their destination.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crow Hunts Worms</strong> is an arcade-y action-puzzle game where you analyze, shoot and collapse worms, it may look simple at first but as you progress you will meet different and stronger enemies with environmental obstacles to play around</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COLLAPSE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/f667c7701292b13527f788e703cdfde6.poster.avif?t=1788253852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/f667c7701292b13527f788e703cdfde6.webm?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/f667c7701292b13527f788e703cdfde6.mp4?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Power-ups<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/b2230a1d7cd211da79c7cd94998d9878.poster.avif?t=1788253852\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/b2230a1d7cd211da79c7cd94998d9878.webm?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/b2230a1d7cd211da79c7cd94998d9878.mp4?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose temporary Power-ups during each level to define your build. Strengthen your weapon, alter its firing behavior, and discover combinations that can transform a difficult infestation into a spectacular chain reaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SKILL TREE<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/71931cf86088ad24fb2037fa7bc94f50.poster.avif?t=1788253852\" width=754 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/71931cf86088ad24fb2037fa7bc94f50.webm?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/extras/71931cf86088ad24fb2037fa7bc94f50.mp4?t=1788253852\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between levels, invest your earnings into permanent weapon upgrades. Specialize the Pistol for precise single-target damage or rapid automatic fire, unlock the Shotgun for multi-target pressure, and equip different reload patterns that change how colors are arranged inside your magazine.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIZE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission introduces a new path and a different tactical problem. Face fast swarms, durable formations, shielded segments, synchronized chains, and carefully authored color arrangements while preventing the worms from reaching their destination.</p>", "short_description": "An arcade-y action-puzzle game where you analyze, shoot and collapse worms, it may look simple at first but as you progress you will meet different and stronger enemies with obstacles to play around", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/c1569a9a8381d2df7f9c0faef49082b17f338427/header.jpg?t=1788253852", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/108676802b0efc9ebe9a51d87170d2c882628c6e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788253852", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4276870/108676802b0efc9ebe9a51d87170d2c882628c6e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788253852", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core processor, 2.0 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DirectX 11 compatible graphics card with 1 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core processor, 2.5 GHz or 